{"id": "DdWtJm_T07C", "title": "Video by petergriffin.ai", "description": "4 Claude Plugins That Make You a Beast at Coding \n\nClaude Code can be insanely powerful, but these four plugins can take your coding workflow to another level.\n\nPonytail helps reduce unnecessary token usage, OmniRoute gives Claude Code access to hundreds of AI providers, Graphify turns your codebase into a knowledge graph, and AgentSkills gives Claude dedicated skills for planning, coding, testing, and publishing.\n\nTogether, they can help you write cleaner code, understand your projects better, and build faster with Claude Code.\n\nIf you're into AI coding, vibe coding, frontend development, web development, or UI/UX, you'll want to check these out.\n\nComment \"CLAUDE\" below, and I'll DM you the links. \n\n[keywords: Claude Code, Claude AI, Claude plugins, AI coding, AI programming, Anthropic, frontend development, web development, web design, UI design, UX design, AI website builder, vibe coding, Ponytail, OmniRoute, Graphify, AgentSkills, Playwright CLI, Playwright, design systems, UI/UX, coding assistant, AI developer tools, developer productivity, prompt engineering]\n\n#claudecode #claudeai #coding #anthropic #programming", "channel": "petergriffin.ai", "uploader_id": "78221441331", "uploader": "Peter Griffin AI", "timestamp": 1789575856, "like_count": 59039, "comment_count": 1044, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1560909291799349a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 54.379, "asr": 44100, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec"