text": "Wow", "timestamp": 1790574055, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "pizzzadeliveryguy", "author_id": "48745850635", "id": "17903628735596707", "text": "Claude", "timestamp": 1790573463, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "pralhad__r", "author_id": "4639951787", "id": "18105636239206450", "text": "@save.to.list", "timestamp": 1790571036, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "david.cuevas.133", "author_id": "71414581543", "id": "17949333309320227", "text": "learn HTML, CSS, and JS to correct any mistakes it makes. Maybe even learn a framework for more flexibility. Why have the model do everything for you if you're just gonna run out of tokens trying to fix something you could have easily corrected by hand in seconds? Yes, AI makes the process way faster, but you should also know what you're doing and have the ability to step in whenever minor inconveniences show up.", "timestamp": 1790570962, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "hii.dewansh", "author_id": "6866647487", "id": "18120780718921087", "text": "CLAUDE", "timestamp": 1790570489, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "uday_pawar31", "author_id": "73214715948", "id": "17899356621387013", "text": "Omnicode once an ai ratelimit reach it takes forever to understand the codebase for another model", "timestamp": 1790564469, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdWtJm_T07C/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DdWtJm_T07C/", "webpage_url_basename": "DdWtJm_T07C", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fvga8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/810319879_1409181357434105_1087540408803824106_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=Mzk4NzU3MzA5MjUxNTc5NDYyNjE1NjA5MDk2MDE3OTkzMTg%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fbmZyYW1lX2NvdmVyX2ZyYW1lLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=IMHmY84SM7IQ7kNvwEBRVIk&_nc_oc=AdrrwlJqZN_tM_axR6TEIlufdnuUjO